---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import AuthorBio from '../../components/AuthorBio.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About Korea Playlist" description="The purpose, editorial approach and operator of Korea Playlist." canonical="/en/about/" locale="en">
  <section class="page-shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>About Korea Playlist</h1>
    <div class="page-copy">
      <p>Korea Playlist helps readers compare Korean destinations, itineraries, transport, food and accommodation areas. Its guides bring together route choices, budgets and practical checks before departure.</p>
      <h2>Editorial approach</h2>
      <p>Travel information can change. Opening hours, fares, transport and booking conditions should be checked with the responsible operator before a visit. Suggested routes and budgets are planning guidance, not guarantees.</p>
      <h2>Corrections and image questions</h2>
      <p>Readers can report outdated details, broken links or image-rights questions through our <a href="/en/contact/">contact page</a>. Please include the article address and the information that needs checking.</p>
      <AuthorBio locale="en" compact />
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
